<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Bienvenue dans la newsletter Atlantic Energy</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A2240 0%, #1B3A6B 100%);
        color: #fff;
        padding: 44px 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header .brand {
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 4px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        opacity: 0.65;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }
      .header p {
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 300;
        opacity: 0.85;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 40px 30px;
      }
      .welcome-text {
        font-size: 16px;
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        color: #444;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .coupon-container {
        border: 2px dashed #E87722;
        background-color: #fffaf6;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 28px 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }
      .coupon-title {
        font-size: 13px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        color: #888;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .coupon-code {
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #0A2240;
        margin: 10px 0;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
      }
      .coupon-desc {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #888;
        margin-top: 6px;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: block;
        width: fit-content;
        margin: 36px auto 10px;
        padding: 16px 44px;
        background-color: #E87722;
        color: #fff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 15px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(232, 119, 34, 0.3);
      }
      .features {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-around;
        margin-top: 36px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        padding-top: 28px;
        text-align: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }
      .feature-item {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #555;
        flex: 1;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .footer {
        background-color: #0A2240;
        padding: 28px 20px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
      }
      .footer a {
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
        text-decoration: none;
        margin: 0 5px;
      }
      .footer .footer-brand {
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #fff;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="brand">Atlantic Energy</div>
        <h1>Bienvenue !</h1>
        <p>Merci de rejoindre notre newsletter</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p class="welcome-text">
          Vous êtes désormais inscrit aux actualités d'<strong>Atlantic Energy</strong>.
          Recevez en avant-première nos nouveaux produits, promotions exclusives
          et conseils techniques.
        </p>

        <div class="coupon-container">
          <div class="coupon-title">Votre code promo de bienvenue</div>
          <div class="coupon-code"><%= COUPON_CODE %></div>
          <div class="coupon-desc">
            Profitez de votre réduction sur votre prochaine commande
          </div>
        </div>

        <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6">
          Utilisez ce code lors du passage de votre commande.<br />
          Valable sur tout notre catalogue de produits.
        </p>

        <a href="<%= SHOP_URL %>/catalogue" class="cta-button">
          Découvrir le catalogue
        </a>

        <div class="features">
          <div class="feature-item">
            <strong>⚡ Distributeur Officiel</strong><br />EATON & SUNLIGHT
          </div>
          <div class="feature-item">
            <strong>🛠️ Support Technique</strong><br />Équipe d'experts
          </div>
          <div class="feature-item">
            <strong>🚚 Livraison Rapide</strong><br />Partout au Maroc
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <div class="footer-brand">ATLANTIC ENERGY</div>
        <p>© <%= YEAR %> Atlantic Energy. Tous droits réservés.</p>
        <p>
          <a href="<%= SHOP_URL %>">Site</a> |
          <a href="<%= SHOP_URL %>/catalogue">Catalogue</a> |
          <a href="<%= SHOP_URL %>/contact">Contact</a>
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px; font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.7">
          Vous recevez cet email car vous vous êtes inscrit à la newsletter Atlantic Energy.<br />
          Pour vous désabonner, contactez-nous.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
